**Known issues carried as is, all logged in `worklog.md`:**
- **Frozen base text:**
  - jumbo's Texas minimum age (62) is higher than the 60 minimum of four Summit plans, though the parameter is described as a "lower age".
  - jumbo doesn't say how much of a prepayment goes back to the line.
  - propcharge has a few lifecycle gaps.
